    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e88291ffc8a845e3b33658fed8c5a034",
      "statement": "The core loop, run_dispatch_cycle, acquires a process-level exclusive file lock (fcntl.flock LOCK_EX | LOCK_NB) before mutating board state, serializing concurrent dispatch cycles.",
